causes `Condition \"!v.is_finite()\" is true.` error.\r\nIt's not very obvious what does it mean.\r\n\r\nThis PR changes error message to  `Transform is non-finite {Vector3}` instead.\r\nThis should make it easier for developers to figure out what does the error mean, and printing Vector3 should also hopefully help them identify what could've caused the issue, i.e. if there's an infinity in coordinates, there might be a division by zero somewhere in the code.\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6a359df5-75e0-42ec-bde1-d793e299c2d1)\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\n1. Create a MeshInstance3D\r\n2. Set mesh to Cube\r\n3. Assign a new script to it\r\n```gdscript\r\nextends Node3D\r\n\r\n\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\tself.position.x = NAN\r\n```\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"h